  "description": "Eunho, the strongest in the yokai realm!\nHe gained the chance to become a human being after losing the woman he loved and killing countless yokai.\nAfter passing the gate of reincarnation by accumulating merit for a thousand years to abandon his immortal body…\n\nHe became a human being, held a sword, and learned martial arts for the first time.\nBut this is very… easy?\n\n(Source: Kakao Entertainment Corp., translated)",
